{"chapters":[{"title":"Max-heap of fuel already driven past","code":"def min_refuel_stops(target, start_fuel, stations):\n    passed = []                    # max-heap of fuel amounts, negated\n    fuel, stops, i = start_fuel, 0, 0\n\n    while fuel < target:\n        while i < len(stations) and stations[i][0] <= fuel:\n            heapq.heappush(passed, -stations[i][1])\n            i += 1\n        if not passed:\n            return -1              # cannot reach any further station\n        fuel -= heapq.heappop(passed)\n        stops += 1\n    return stops","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Max-heap of fuel already driven past</strong> &mdash; O(n log n) time, O(n) extra space. Input: <code>min_refuel_stops(target=1000, start_fuel=299, stations=[[13, 21], [26, 115], [100, 47], [225, 99], [299, 141], [444, 198], [608, 190], [636, 157], …])</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":1,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"stations","label":"stations","v":["13,21","26,115","100,47","225,99","299,141","444,198","608,190","636,157","647,255","841,123"],"cls":["","","","","","","","","",""]}],"vars":[["target","1000",0],["start_fuel","299",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>passed = []</code> &mdash; <code>passed = []</code> <em>(max-heap of fuel amounts, negated)</em>","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"stations","label":"stations","v":["13,21","26,115","100,47","225,99","299,141","444,198","608,190","636,157","647,255","841,123"],"cls":["","","","","","","","","",""]},{"t":"arr","id":"passed","label":"passed","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["target","1000",0],["start_fuel","299",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>fuel, stops, i = start_fuel, 0, 0</code> &mdash; <code>fuel = 299</code>; <code>stops = 0</code>; <code>i = 0</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"stations","label":"stations","v":["13,21","26,115","100,47","225,99","299,141","444,198","608,190","636,157","647,255","841,123"],"cls":["src","","","","","","","","",""],"ptr":{"0":["i"]}},